  "body": "From @bzbarsky in https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/1024\r\n\r\nI guess HTML should be explicit about what a form control is.\r\n\r\nMaybe \"form control\" isn't the right concept? We have things like `meter`, `progress`, `marquee`, `details`/`summary`; it's not immediately clear which of these should behave like form controls wrt `display: contents`...",
